    - target: {fileID: 2176869272599355111, guid: 8c60ec10e6d0341438d05d6c6b5e6119, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Peter,\n\nIf you're reading this, I most likely have been captured
        by the government. During my time spent with the government, I have acquired
        some critical information. The government has been secretly working on a
        project called \"Project REBIRTH\", which they plan on using to seize research
        across the city. This includes the cure that you and I have been working
        on. \n\nThe government has no intention of using the cure to save humanity.
        Before my capture, I have hidden the cure in the closet within your bedroom.
        You must keep it safe with you. With the cure, you must head to the hospital.
        That is where we can mass produce it and save humanity. You are humanity's
        last hope.\n\nBe wary, the journey to the lab will be dangerous. You will
        encounter all sorts of creatures and people that might stop you. \n\nBe sure
        to explore to find weapons and items along the way that will make your journey
        easier to traverse. \n\n- Isaac \n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2844078144919458876, guid: 8c60ec10e6d0341438d05d6c6b5e6119, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Note Interactable
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2844078144919458876, guid: 8c60ec10e6d0341438d05d6c6b5e6119, type: 3}
